{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"Astella’s been sitting silently. One might call it meditating if it weren’t for the firestorm of emotions crashing around their mind like a lightning storm around a rickety lighthouse. Normally, they could steady themself among the smoke. But they breathed it in. They gulped it, determined to burn the shortcomings out of them. They lit a small wad of paper on fire with a gadget they made. They’ve used it to brand themself, “*Devilkin*” across their collarbone - not as a mark of greatness but a scar of what they are. They take the heat and lust for it. They want to burn.","created_at":"2020-07-28T03:49:44.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737517124838359100","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"They kneel still, legs cramped, taking a second point of exhaustion from not letting themself move. They sit there, but not once do they cry. They sit silently and with eternal contemplation.","created_at":"2020-07-28T03:52:15.756000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737517757293133845","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"Astella returns and sits back down. They sit in silence. For the first time, they pray.","created_at":"2020-07-28T06:42:47.888000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737560673965572166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"*God. If there is a god. Or gods. Or the souls of those I’ve wronged. My greed had driven me for many years. My sadism in inaction has lead to the deaths of many. My ignorance, my selfishness, and my lust for power and knowledge. I am that person no more. I am that greed-bound devil no more. I will not turn into my father, no matter how I vainly and naively idolized him. I will continue to lay down my life for those I love, however foolish, until you can recognize me. I am not joining this for you, or them, and I suppose that is selfish in itself, but I am joining this for me. For me to aspire to be something good in this world of noble wretches and wretched nobles. I submit myself to your judgement this second time. Do what you will.*","created_at":"2020-07-28T06:48:09.429000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737562022606012468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
