{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"647890633763323924","content":"*I’m here again. I still don’t have proof, but I know if I succeeded in my stupid act, then there must be someone up there, watching. I’m sorry for throwing away my life like that, it was vain and reckless. I needed to prove something. My journey to forgiveness will start now, and I will do what you ask of me. I ask this, though: how may I aid those even when the opportunity doesn’t present itself in the light?*","created_at":"2020-07-29T18:21:37.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738098926225457215","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
